Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 20:48:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] exp: RPM runs the agent as cwagent with eBPF capabilities
 (systemd drop-in)

Adds /etc/systemd/system/amazon-cloudwatch-agent.service.d/ebpf.conf: User=cwagent
plus the 7 ambient capabilities the OBI receiver needs (BPF, PERFMON, SYS_PTRACE,
DAC_READ_SEARCH, CHECKPOINT_RESTORE, NET_RAW, NET_ADMIN; no SYS_ADMIN), and a
root ExecStartPre that chowns logs/ var/ etc/.

start-amazon-cloudwatch-agent skips ChangeUser when it is not started as root:
the setuid it would do is unnecessary, and its chown/setgroups need root.
